{
  "meta": {
    "url": "https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/",
    "description": [
      "打印每个 FILE 的换行、单词和字节计数；指定多个 FILE 时还会打印一行总计。"
    ]
  },
  "option": [
    {
      "name": "--bytes",
      "alias": [
        "-c"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-c, --bytes"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印字节计数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--chars",
      "alias": [
        "-m"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-m, --chars"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印字符计数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--files0-from",
      "usage": [
        "--files0-from <F>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "从文件 F 中以 NUL 结尾的名字所指定的那些文件读取输入；如果 F 是 -，则从标准输入读取名字"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--lines",
      "alias": [
        "-l"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-l, --lines"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印换行计数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--max-line-length",
      "alias": [
        "-L"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-L, --max-line-length"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印最大显示宽度"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--total",
      "usage": [
        "--total <WHEN>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "何时打印一行总计；WHEN 可以是 auto、always、only、never"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "always"
        },
        {
          "name": "auto"
        },
        {
          "name": "never"
        },
        {
          "name": "only"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--words",
      "alias": [
        "-w"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-w, --words"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印单词计数"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "global_option": [
    {
      "name": "--help",
      "tip": [
        "显示此帮助并退出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--version",
      "tip": [
        "输出版本信息并退出"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
